@startuml US202-SSD
autonumber
title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - US202: Register Aircraft Model with Image

actor "Backoffice Operator" as Operator
participant ":System" as System

activate Operator
Operator -> System: initiates the registration of a new aircraft model
activate System

System --> Operator: requests necessary data (manufacturer, model name, seating capacity, fuel capacity, max range, cruising speed, optional image)
deactivate System

Operator -> System: selects manufacturer, inputs the requested data, and optionally attaches an image
activate System

System --> Operator: confirms aircraft model registration and returns details (including image if provided)
deactivate System
deactivate Operator
@enduml
